---
description: Nynorsk full male name — one given name and one surname (Olav Myklebust). Norwegian carries a single surname and it does not change for the bearer's gender, so there is one lastName list for both sexes. The names themselves are register data and are the same in both written standards; what makes this the nn pack is everything around them.
generator: tdc
locale: nn
---
<sequence name="p">
  <gen name="f" type="template" value="nn.person.male.firstName"/>
  <gen name="l" type="template" value="nn.person.lastName"/>
</sequence>
<data>${{p.f}} ${{p.l}}</data>
